#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0287 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "Positive control added by PLAN-absent-guard-test-hardening P3: this rule previously had ONLY an expect=skipped fixture, which asserts non-execution and so proved nothing about the rule ever running at this standard/version. Every one of the 27 required TSPARMCD codes is present, so the check is satisfied. This is the fixture that proves the rule EXECUTES here - the skipped-only scenario could not."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-3
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 1 | ADDON | v-ADDON
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 2 | AGEMAX | v-AGEMAX
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 3 | AGEMIN | v-AGEMIN
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 4 | LENGTH | v-LENGTH
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 5 | PLANSUB | v-PLANSUB
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 6 | RANDOM | v-RANDOM
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 7 | SEXPOP | v-SEXPOP
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 8 | STOPRULE | v-STOPRULE
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 9 | TBLIND | v-TBLIND
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 10 | TCNTRL | v-TCNTRL
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 11 | TITLE | v-TITLE
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 12 | TPHASE | v-TPHASE
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 13 | TTYPE | v-TTYPE
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 14 | OBJPRIM | v-OBJPRIM
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 15 | SPONSOR | v-SPONSOR
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 16 | REGID | v-REGID
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 17 | OUTMSPRI | v-OUTMSPRI
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 18 | FCNTRY | v-FCNTRY
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 19 | ADAPT | v-ADAPT
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 20 | DCUTDTC | v-DCUTDTC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 21 | DCUTDESC | v-DCUTDESC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 22 | NARMS | v-NARMS
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 23 | STYPE | v-STYPE
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 24 | SSTDTC | v-SSTDTC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 25 | SENDTC | v-SENDTC
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 26 | ACTSUB | v-ACTSUB
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 27 | HLTSUBJI | v-HLTSUBJI
---
